com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Looks good! Tested on `Pixel 8a` - Android 16\r\n\r\n\r\n<details> <summary>Suggestions:</summary>\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n- mention in the documentation that `edge_to_edge` does not support every device\r\n- Reference to the Android documentation, there are probably few users who even know what this is https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/layout/edge-to-edge\r\n- Is it possible to change `edge_to_edge` at runtime?\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_displayserver.html#class-displayserver-method-window-set-mode\r\n\r\n- `WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN = 3` **without** `edge_to_edge`?\r\n- `WINDOW_MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN = 4` **with**  `edge_to_edge`?\r\n\r\n-------------------\r\n\r\n- In the `Window Management` demo, I was also able to change `Immersive Mode` at runtime. Perhaps the export settings could be removed(?) if it works at runtime and can be changed via the project settings.\r\n\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _on_button_fullscreen_pressed() -> void:\r\n\tif DisplayServer.window_get_mode() == DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN:\r\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED)\r\n\telse:\r\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e64d20a-8daf-46a3-9528-238bb936e009)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1178903a-d6d0-4e7d-9bf0-6b72c1765c6c)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742#pullrequestreview-2948035805","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107742","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742#pullrequestreview-2948035805"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107742"}},"submitted_at":"2025-06-22T01:46:42Z","commit_id":"2f4c3d411c7b9bdb10c7bc0e746a161ce7b60f26"}]